{"seq":1,"slug":"kit-assembly-fulfill-option","title":"随单组装与预组装：履约时机的选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dynamic-bundle-kit-commerce/bundle-fulfillment/kit-assembly-fulfill-option","wordCount":1846,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"随单组装与预组装-履约时机的选择\">随单组装与预组装：履约时机的选择</h1><p>仓库收到一张组合订单，面前有两条路：从各组件拣货位分别取货、现场配齐后装进套件箱；或者直接从成品库位取一件早就装配好的套装。平台产品对这一点的建模方式可以直接借鉴：Magento 的 bundle 支持将商品标记为「一起发货（Together）」或「分别发货（Separately）」，并规定选择一起发货时所有项必须使用同一库存来源（见 <a href=\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/docs/commerce-admin/catalog/products/types/product-create-bundle\">Adobe Commerce bundle products</a>）。这条约束正是预组装的经济前提——只有当组件来自同一来源、能被一次性配齐时，装配成一件成品才有意义。本篇给出判定依据、各自的作业流程，以及一个常被忽略的约束——<strong>虚拟组合根本不能预组装</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>面</th>\n<th>随单组装 assemble-to-order</th>\n<th>预组装 assemble-to-stock</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>库存形态</td>\n<td>只有组件库存</td>\n<td>组件库存 + 成品库存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拣货步数</td>\n<td>每组合多步（按组件数）</td>\n<td>一步（拣一件成品）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资金占用</td>\n<td>低（不提前投入装配与套件包装）</td>\n<td>高（成品在库）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缺件影响</td>\n<td>缺任一组件即整单卡住</td>\n<td>成品可独立调拨，抗缺件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变更风险</td>\n<td>组件替换灵活</td>\n<td>组合定义变更后成品可能呆滞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用组合类型</td>\n<td>虚拟组合 / 长尾组合</td>\n<td>实体套装 / 高周转组合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[组合订单] --&gt; B{组合是否有成品库存}&#10;  B --&gt;|无, 虚拟组合| C[随单组装]&#10;  B --&gt;|有| D{成品库存是否充足}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[拣成品, 一步出库]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F{是否允许缺件回退}&#10;  F --&gt;|允许| C&#10;  F --&gt;|不允许| G[拆单或延期]\">graph TD\n  A[组合订单] --&gt; B{组合是否有成品库存}\n  B --&gt;|无, 虚拟组合| C[随单组装]\n  B --&gt;|有| D{成品库存是否充足}\n  D --&gt;|是| E[拣成品, 一步出库]\n  D --&gt;|否| F{是否允许缺件回退}\n  F --&gt;|允许| C\n  F --&gt;|不允许| G[拆单或延期]</pre><h3 id=\"虚拟组合的硬约束\">虚拟组合的硬约束</h3><p>上一章已经说明虚拟组合没有独立库存。这一性质在履约侧的直接推论是：<strong>虚拟组合只能随单组装</strong>。不存在「虚拟组合的成品」这种东西可供拣选。若业务要求预组装带来的拣货效率，那么组合身份必须先在 <a href=\"../bundle-model/virtual-kit-vs-physical-assembly\">虚拟组合商品 vs 实体组装套装</a> 那一层改为实体套装，这是不可绕过的顺序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预组装的成本临界点\">预组装的成本临界点</h2><p>预组装是否划算，取决于装配人力成本与节省的拣货时间之间的比较。设单次装配耗时为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，单次随单组装的额外拣货耗时为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，单位时间人力成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span>，成品在库平均停留 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 天、持有成本率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>、装配成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>预组装净收益</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>呆滞</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>cost</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{预组装净收益} = Q \\cdot (t_p - t_a) \\cdot w - Q \\cdot C_a \\cdot h \\cdot T - Q \\cdot \\Pr(\\text{呆滞}) \\cdot \\text{cost}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">预组装净收益</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">Pr</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">呆滞</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>最后一项是组合定义变更导致成品呆滞的期望损失。这一项在快消、季节性、联名款场景下可能主导整个决策——<strong>预组装的真正风险不是装配成本，而是变更后的呆滞库存</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"何时应当预组装\">何时应当预组装</h3><p>判断信号有三条，满足两条以上即可考虑：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>组合周转高</strong>：该组合的日均销量显著高于装配批量，成品能在短期内售罄。</li>\n<li><strong>组合定义稳定</strong>：组件清单在可预见期内不会变更（无季节替换、无供应商切换）。</li>\n<li><strong>装配步骤复杂</strong>：现场配齐需要特殊操作（校验序列号、配对、贴标）导致随单组装耗时远超普通拣货。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>第 3 条常被忽略。对于需要序列号配对的组合（如相机机身与镜头需记录配对关系以便保修），随单组装会让拣货员承担本应由装配工位完成的配对工作，出错率高且拖慢整体拣货。这类组合即便周转一般也值得预组装。</p>\n<h2 id=\"组装工位的作业契约\">组装工位的作业契约</h2><p>无论哪条路线，装配动作都必须在库存账本上留下可追溯的记录。预组装产出的成品库存与消耗的组件库存必须成对出现，且整单原子。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 组装工单状态机&#10;-- CREATED -&gt; PICKED -&gt; ASSEMBLED -&gt; CLOSED&#10;--   任一环节失败 -&gt; CANCELLED（组件回滚至原库位）&#10;CREATE TABLE kit_work_order (&#10;  wo_id        VARCHAR(64) PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  kit_sku      VARCHAR(64) NOT NULL,&#10;  qty          INT         NOT NULL,&#10;  status       VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,&#10;  picked_at    TIMESTAMP,&#10;  assembled_at TIMESTAMP,&#10;  closed_at    TIMESTAMP,&#10;  scrap_qty    INT         NOT NULL DEFAULT 0&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 组装工单状态机</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- CREATED -> PICKED -> ASSEMBLED -> CLOSED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">--   任一环节失败 -> CANCELLED（组件回滚至原库位）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> kit_work_order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  wo_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  kit_sku      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  qty          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  picked_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  assembled_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  closed_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  scrap_qty    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>scrap_qty</code> 记录装配过程中报废的组件数量。它不该被忽略：报废量若长期不记录，成品成本与组件消耗会对不上，且装配环节的质量问题无法被发现。报废的成本应按本 hub <a href=\"../bundle-inventory-price/bundle-price-allocation-component\">Bundle 价格/折扣在组件上的分摊</a> 的口径计入组合成本，而不是直接冲减库存了事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"混合策略-按需求特征分流\">混合策略：按需求特征分流</h2><p>多数成熟系统最终采用混合策略，按组合的需求特征分流，而不是全局二选一：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组合特征</th>\n<th>履约方式</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高周转 + 定义稳定</td>\n<td>预组装</td>\n<td>拣货效率收益最大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高周转 + 常变更</td>\n<td>随单组装 + 组件预拣</td>\n<td>避免呆滞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低周转长尾</td>\n<td>随单组装</td>\n<td>不值得投入装配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需序列号配对</td>\n<td>预组装</td>\n<td>配对作业集中化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大件/异形</td>\n<td>随单组装</td>\n<td>成品仓储成本过高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"履约方式应当可运行时切换\">履约方式应当可运行时切换</h3><p>把一个组合永久绑定到某一种履约方式是不必要的僵化。合理的做法是在组合定义上放一个 <code>fulfillment_mode</code> 字段，取值允许 <code>auto</code>，由 WMS 根据当前成品库存与组件库存动态决定：有成品就拣成品，没有就回退到随单组装。这个回退路径让预组装的收益可以被享受，而风险被封顶——成品不足时不会卡单。</p>\n<p><code>fulfillment_mode = auto</code> 的判定顺序必须是「先查成品、再回退组件」，反过来会让已有成品永远不被消耗，最终累积成呆滞。</p>\n<h2 id=\"装配质量的度量\">装配质量的度量</h2><p>装配环节引入了一类单品不存在的质量风险：<strong>配错件</strong>。把镜头 A 的机身配了镜头 B，或漏放一件赠品，这类错误在单品拣货里不会发生，在组合里却会出现。度量它需要一组专门的指标。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>装配一次通过率</td>\n<td>无返工的装配工单占比</td>\n<td>越高越好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配错件率</td>\n<td>客诉「组合件不对」的订单占比</td>\n<td>越低越好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>装配报废率</td>\n<td><code>scrap_qty / 消耗组件量</code></td>\n<td>稳定且有记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成品呆滞率</td>\n<td>超过阈值未售出的成品占比</td>\n<td>低于设定上限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>配错件率的分子应当从客诉与退货原因里专门切出来，而不是混在整体客诉率里——它直接指向装配工位的作业质量，是可修复的。若该指标在引入预组装后显著上升，通常说明装配工位的校验步骤（对照 BOM 逐件核对、扫码确认）缺失。</p>\n<h3 id=\"装配的扫码校验\">装配的扫码校验</h3><p>最有效的防错手段是在装配工位逐件扫码：每次扫描校验该组件是否在当前组合的 BOM 内、数量是否超限。这与 <a href=\"../bundle-model/bundle-sku-component-masterdata\">Bundle SKU 与组件主数据映射</a> 的映射表是同一份数据，工位终端直接读它即可，不需要额外的配置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>随单组装资金占用低但拣货步数多，预组装拣货快但引入成品库存与呆滞风险。</li>\n<li>虚拟组合没有成品库存，只能随单组装；要预组装必须先在身份层改为实体套装。</li>\n<li>预组装的真正风险是组合定义变更后的呆滞库存，而非装配人力成本。</li>\n<li>需序列号配对的组合即使周转一般也值得预组装，因为配对作业应当集中化。</li>\n<li>混合策略按「周转 × 稳定性 × 复杂度」分流，且履约方式应可在运行时回退。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>组装完成后，多个组件可能来自不同仓库，进入 <a href=\"bundle-split-ship-tracking\">Bundle 拆单发货与追踪</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"随单组装与预组装：履约时机的选择","id":"随单组装与预组装-履约时机的选择"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"虚拟组合的硬约束","id":"虚拟组合的硬约束"},{"level":2,"text":"预组装的成本临界点","id":"预组装的成本临界点"},{"level":3,"text":"何时应当预组装","id":"何时应当预组装"},{"level":2,"text":"组装工位的作业契约","id":"组装工位的作业契约"},{"level":2,"text":"混合策略：按需求特征分流","id":"混合策略-按需求特征分流"},{"level":3,"text":"履约方式应当可运行时切换","id":"履约方式应当可运行时切换"},{"level":2,"text":"装配质量的度量","id":"装配质量的度量"},{"level":3,"text":"装配的扫码校验","id":"装配的扫码校验"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Bundle 毛利与清库存、搭售目标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dynamic-bundle-kit-commerce/bundle-inventory-price/bundle-margin-clearance-goal"},"next":{"title":"Bundle 拆单发货与追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dynamic-bundle-kit-commerce/bundle-fulfillment/bundle-split-ship-tracking"}}